{"name":"Procurea - Workspace MCP Gateway","nodes":[{"parameters":{"content":"## Procurea – Workspace MCP Gateway\n\nExposes procurement-safe Gmail and Google Drive actions through MCP.\n\n### MCP tools\n1. `search_vendor_emails` — find vendor quotation emails\n2. `read_gmail_quotation` — read PDF quotation attachments from Gmail\n3. `search_quote_files` — search quotation files in Google Drive\n4. `read_drive_quotation` — read a quotation PDF from Drive\n5. `send_gmail_email` — send procurement emails\n6. `Call_Procurea_MCP_-_Upload_Drive_File_` — create/upload the PO draft through the helper workflow\n\n### After import\n- Select Gmail credentials on Gmail nodes/tools.\n- Select Google Drive credentials on Drive nodes/tools.\n- Select/create Bearer Auth on the MCP Server Trigger.\n- Re-select the upload helper workflow if your n8n instance assigns a new workflow ID.\n- Activate the helper workflow and this gateway, then use the production MCP URL.\n\nNo OAuth tokens or API keys are stored in this repository.","height":520,"width":620,"color":5},"id":"7dcb9fa8-7f4d-4721-a38e-bbed8d2d5d3a","name":"SETUP - READ ME","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[0,16]},{"parameters":{"authentication":"bearerAuth","path":"procurea-workspace-mcp"},"id":"d78f1e30-ed90-4183-aa23-9a8f67755ae6","name":"Procurea MCP Server","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.mcpTrigger","typeVersion":2,"position":[400,336]},{"parameters":{"descriptionType":"manual","toolDescription":"Search Gmail for procurement and vendor quotation emails. Use Gmail search syntax such as has:attachment, subject:, from:, or a PR reference.","operation":"getAll","limit":"={{ $fromAI('limit', 'Maximum number of matching emails to return', 'number', 10) }}","simple":false,"filters":{"q":"={{ $fromAI('search_query', 'Gmail search query for the vendor quotation email, for example: has:attachment PR-2026-001', 'string') }}"},"options":{}},"id":"6a64f0a0-9cd2-4c25-b815-1e244bf5c043","name":"search_vendor_emails","type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmailTool","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[176,592]},{"parameters":{"description":"Download PDF quotation attachment(s) from a Gmail message and return extracted text. Use the Gmail message ID returned by search_vendor_emails.","workflowId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"id","value":"={{ $workflow.id }}"},"workflowInputs":{"mappingMode":"defineBelow","value":{"operation":"readGmailQuotation","messageId":"={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('messageId', 'Gmail message ID containing the vendor quotation attachment', 'string') }}","fileId":""},"matchingColumns":[],"schema":[{"id":"operation","displayName":"operation","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"canBeUsedToMatch":true,"type":"string","removed":false},{"id":"messageId","displayName":"messageId","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"canBeUsedToMatch":true,"type":"string","removed":false},{"id":"fileId","displayName":"fileId","required":false,"defaultMatch":false,"display":true,"canBeUsedToMatch":true,"type":"string","removed":false}],"attemptToConvertTypes":false,"convertFieldsToString":false}},"id":"a02016de-abb0-4588-84bc-b11728a01b5f","name":"read_gmail_quotation","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.toolWorkflow","typeVersion":2.2,"position":[880,608]},{"parameters":{"descriptionType":"manual","toolDescription":"Search Google Drive for procurement quotation files. Search by vendor name, PR reference, quotation number, or filename.","resource":"fileFolder","queryString":"={{ /*n8n-auto-generated-fromAI-override*/ $fromAI('Search_Query', 'Search text for the quotation file in Google Drive', 'string') }}","limit":10,"filter":{"driveId":{"__rl":true,"mode":"list","value":"My Drive"},"whatToSearch":"files"},"options":{}},"id":"9a1b4ad1-7896-437b-9dff-bfba02fded40","name":"search_quote_files","type":"n8n-nodes-base.googleDriveTool","typeVersion":3,"position":[1056,608]},{"parameters":{"description":"Download a PDF quotation from Google Drive and ret